/ app-systems: every %!app.X% is the type X, and the plang path, the C# path and the file path say the same thing.
/ Done: 1–8g, and 8h's code parts (see done.list). Each step below names the test that validates it; tests live at
/ the path of what they test. Checks that can't be a test are in checks.md. Tests are built only when Ingi says so.
AppSystems
- call Stage8h
- call Stage9
- call Stage10
- call Stage11
- call Stage12

Stage8h
/ the builder builds itself, and plain words compile to what they mean
- "retry once" is one retry                                       / Test/Module/On/Error/RetryOnceMeansOneRetry
- "if %done%, return %x%" returns from inside the if              / Test/Module/Condition/If/IfReturnReturns
- render takes its arguments by name                              / Test/Module/Ui/Render/RenderTakesNamedArguments
- the builder rebuilds its own goals with no reader for the old format    / checks.md
- the decider asks stage 1's common questions, and the eval measures it  / checks.md

Stage9
/ every value is born through its type, so a program can hook any value's birth; handlers hand over in one line
- "after file create" fires when a file value is born              / Test/App/Type/File/CreateFiresOnBirth
- every existing test passes; each handler hands over in one line  / checks.md

Stage10
/ the app knows its types, and its own facts are plang values
- the app lists its types                                         / Test/App/Type/AppListsItsTypes
- a plugin's type joins the app                                   / Test/App/Type/PluginTypeJoinsTheApp
- one name, one type: a plugin can't take a built-in's name       / Test/App/Type/OneNameOneType
- the app's facts are plang values                                / Test/App/AppFactsArePlangValues
- a typed list holds its type                                     / Test/App/Type/List/TypedListHoldsItsType
- the app's name is its setting                                   / Test/App/Setting/AppNameIsItsSetting

Stage11
/ one door per thing; C# tests reach the app through its own doors
- one door to an actor: %!app.actor.system%, not %!app.system%   / Test/App/Actor/OneDoorToAnActor
- the builder warns about a goal nothing reaches                   / checks.md
- every C# test passes with TestApp and TestAction deleted         / checks.md

Stage12
/ a programmer's mistake is an error with its own key, never a crash
- a value that takes no child is an error result                  / Test/App/Type/Item/SetChildOnAValueIsAnError
- an unknown setting is an error result                           / Test/App/Setting/UnknownSettingIsAnError
